Files-Excluded:
 dist/async.js
 dist/async.min.js
 docs/v2
 docs/v3
 support/jsdoc/theme/static/scripts/prettify
Comment:
 Excluded files: the prettify directory contains minified versions of the
 prettify scripts, found in libjs-prettify.
 .
 We also exclude the generated async.js files and generated documentation.
 The documentation was built using jsdoc, which is not currently in Debian
 (there is an RFP #774565 for it).  We are not building a -doc package for
 node-async, so this is not an issue.

